			<div class="content" id="post-content-4791061">
									

<p>After losing all their Sons in WW2, a Sarkic cult based in Nevada stages a revolt and the US tries to deal with it. It does not go well.</p>
<p><em>I moved and trimmed your thread summary, since it was taking up extra space in the main forum screen. Try to keep thread descriptions (the text in the little box under the thread title) and titles short so you don't crowd out other authors in the forum listing. ~Zyn</em></p>
<p>Greenlights are here —&gt; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13240521/scp-idea">http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-13240521/scp-idea</a></p>
<p>The draft is here —&gt; <a href="http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/thesilentking">http://scpsandbox2.wikidot.com/thesilentking</a></p>
<p>Word Count: 4535</p>
<p>This is my first attempt as a proper SCP article and I hope I can get it approved ^^</p>
<p>In terms of specifics, I'm hoping that some specifics could be given about the emotions, clinical tone but any general feedback will be appreciated.</p>
<p>All I ask is that you be specific with your feedback as in the past I have been given general suggestions for improvement rather than anything concrete.</p>
<p>Thanks!</p>
<p>Edit: Several errors and inconsistencies have been made. Several plot holes have also been sorted. Also, I would greatly appreciate it if future critiques could provide suggestions and alternatives for improvements as well, please.</p>
<p>Edit 2: Description has been shortened with a lot of the irrelevant information cut. As well as a few other minor improvements.</p>

